@startuml message_passing_adapter_timeout_flow
!theme plain
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam shadowing false

title Client-Side Request Timeout

actor Application
participant "MessagePassingControlClient" as Client
participant "ClientSession" as ClientSession
participant "PendingCallRegistry" as PendingRegistry
participant "PendingCall" as PendingCall
participant "IClientConnection" as ClientConnection
participant "SCORE message-passing IPC" as Transport

Application -> Client: SendRequest(request, timeout)
Client -> ClientSession: SendRequest(request, timeout)
ClientSession -> PendingRegistry: Register request ID and pending call
ClientSession -> ClientConnection: **IClientConnection::Send(request bytes)**
ClientConnection -> Transport: Send IPC message
ClientSession -> PendingRegistry: WaitForResponse(deadline + grace)
PendingRegistry -> PendingCall: WaitForResponse(deadline + grace)
PendingCall -> PendingCall: **condition_variable.wait_until(...)**
PendingCall --> PendingRegistry: Response wait timed out
PendingRegistry -> PendingRegistry: Fail pending call; remove request ID
PendingRegistry --> ClientSession: Client-side timeout
ClientSession --> Client: Return timeout
Client --> Application: Operation response timed out

@enduml